ReXGlue input: report which kind of controller is connected (for button prompts).

rex::input::ConnectedPadStyle() (rex/input/pad_style.h) says whether the first connected
controller is a PlayStation pad (SDL gamepad type PS3 / PS4 / PS5), another pad (Xbox), or
there is none. The SDL driver updates it whenever a controller is added or removed. A game
can use it to show matching button prompts.

